  "name": {
   "zh": "人体分割 · Sapiens2",
   "en": "Body Segmentation · Sapiens2"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "Sapiens2 是一组高分辨率 transformer，面向以人为中心的视觉任务，重点在泛化、通用和高保真输出；身体部位分割比第一代高 24.3 mIoU。这张卡整幅画面逐帧做身体部位分割和人物 alpha，交付一套多层 EXR：部位写成 Cryptomatte（CryptoObject），人物 alpha 一层（alpha）。",
   "en": "Sapiens2 is a family of high-resolution transformers for human-centric vision tasks, focused on generalization, versatility and high-fidelity output; its body-part segmentation is 24.3 mIoU higher than the first generation. This card does body-part segmentation and a person alpha for the whole image per frame and delivers a multi-layer EXR: the parts as Cryptomatte (CryptoObject) and one layer of person alpha (alpha)."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "mask",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
